<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-26T22:28:49.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a Plateau community, killing 16 and injuring four, while suspected militants killed at least 30 people in Niger state. Bandits abducted six people in Kaduna and six in Chikun LGA, and gunmen opened fire on Peter Obi supporters in Edo, injuring one person. President Tinubu pledged to rescue abducted schoolchildren in Borno and to intensify operations against terrorists, while law enforcement officials reaffirmed a refusal to negotiate with bandits. Amnesty International condemned the Tinubu government for inaction after a mass burial of Plateau victims. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNTHRIOXFBRXE1M1RqOTFHZXZkVHc2Tzh4T0lqVlVndDhLYjZDT01INE1BM1FBSWxpMFVyMkFkUFEwVHFDcnFfblBmTmdWR3FFNGRPSzU1UFV6SFdBVm9iUEJHNko5M2hLUjhvWTUweTNyTGNoZlNlZWVESk9IWTBBV1dWNVhEVUxDMW51Mi0ydUdnbEZhbmVyREJzNngwZHkwVHFEdmZzaUh3RjA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUW5aeXpDUldIYjR5RlZ2bVdyUHFKZUtRcEUwTERNc3ZTRVFWTlNRSEZjV05VMVNyNG1KTXZNelVaQUJVaUlObUlqYXl5MV85b0hrTDdJMlA4YVcyanRXVVhrV19vUjBqRmR2WDBzcnY2MlFsTjdoS0paNGFTQWdESk5Lcm9GeWNSbUN6dkJwbDhwWk5WR1FqWXVWS1dYVjFVcElvNDd2RS11NnprbVVUdWl3cVVkVC16?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNaGs3TW1zQjBQVlpyVTdWd1QyZGtVS2E5VDYyN3ZwVWdQbHdHYkMyb1B6SkFDSWUwU0FLVjlIdDJBVzFNZS00bU5uZDdXU3gzVzFrd05uRF9Vc1ZxV1hYc3U0UE5IM0JJM0pqZDhRcGFOYlE4LUhjbmxQNGNndmdQS2QzeVRkd2FSeWJYU2J1Zi1salI5ZjdGbmRVVEdpNGRNdFVMbFZaQnlVcV9UQ09GYTI2MTJKdXZuZENKWDlISl8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFBvc1pBc2R4TEkwV01STVYtcjhoX2xEZkd4dWJfbjdyZTVhMlpWWEgwQ1dWb2Q5RU1sSzhVZnlJM